Package: monito
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, systemd
Description: per-application Linux network traffic monitor
 Monito records network usage by application and provides a terminal dashboard
 for daily totals and live transfer rates. Includes the privileged collector
 and its systemd service. Requires cgroup v2, kernel BTF, and eBPF support.
